@startuml
actor Пользователь
participant ChatApp
participant CommandRegistry
participant CommandCatalog
participant MessageFactory
participant IClock
participant IChatStore
participant RoomState
participant RingBuffer
participant ILogSink
participant IPresenter

Пользователь -> ChatApp : execute("/msg #a Привет")
ChatApp -> ChatApp : Lexer::tokenize
ChatApp -> CommandRegistry : execute("/msg", args)
CommandRegistry -> CommandRegistry : check arity (compile-time)
CommandRegistry -> CommandRegistry : convert<RoomName>, convert<string>
CommandRegistry -> CommandCatalog : handler(room, text)
CommandCatalog -> MessageFactory : text("Никита", "Привет")
MessageFactory -> IClock : now()
IClock --> MessageFactory : time_point
MessageFactory --> CommandCatalog : Message
CommandCatalog -> IChatStore : post("#a", Message)
IChatStore -> ILogSink : append("[#a] Никита: Привет")
IChatStore -> RoomState : post(Message)
RoomState -> RingBuffer : push_back(Message)
RingBuffer -> RingBuffer : вытеснение старого при переполнении
CommandCatalog -> IPresenter : success("Отправлено")
IPresenter --> Пользователь : вывод
@enduml